---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { images } from '../data/assets';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Talon Expeditions" description="Talon Expeditions is a U.S.-based group travel planning and active travel brand serving private groups, clubs, communities and businesses worldwide." image={images.heroAlt}>
  <section class="page-hero" style={`background-image:url('${images.heroAlt}')`}><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">About Talon Expeditions</p><h1 class="section-title">A group travel partner for people who want the trip to be about more than logistics.</h1><p>U.S.-based planning, worldwide travel, and a practical focus on helping organizers create journeys their people can actually join and enjoy.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="shell content-split"><aside class="side-card"><p class="eyebrow">Our role</p><h2>Make ambitious group travel easier to organize.</h2><p>We connect the experience, planning, logistics, and traveler preparation into one supported process.</p><a class="button" href="/contact/">Talk With Talon</a></aside><div class="prose"><h2>Travel is better when the support disappears into the background.</h2><p>Talon Expeditions plans active, cultural, skill-based, and private group travel around the world. We work with organizers, communities, clubs, businesses, and travelers who want a more supported way to create meaningful journeys.</p><p>Our job is not to make every trip feel the same. It is to make the difficult parts coherent, so the experience itself has room to be distinctive.</p><h3>Group-first by design</h3><p>Private groups are the core of the business. That means thinking beyond bookings and itineraries to group fit, communication, readiness, pacing, and the organizer experience.</p><h3>Part of Talon</h3><p>Talon Expeditions operates as Talon Global LLC dba Talon Expeditions.</p></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
